1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Subs by Mkrm

2
00:01:26,440 --> 00:01:26,940
Oh no!

3
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:28,380
It's an egg.

4
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:30,940
Hey, Mark, what kind of shoes are you wearing?

5
00:01:33,060 --> 00:01:34,110
This might become

6
00:01:34,120 --> 00:01:35,400
the trendiest look this year.

7
00:01:36,040 --> 00:01:36,540
Exactly.

8
00:01:37,480 --> 00:01:39,420
We were used to you being so carefree.

9
00:01:39,580 --> 00:01:40,860
Suddenly becoming so gentle,

10
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:42,300
I find it scary.

11
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:45,180
Their little tricks—

12
00:01:46,600 --> 00:01:48,540
they haven't even seen my true Speed.

13
00:01:49,960 --> 00:01:51,900
What kind of Signature Moves could they possibly have?

14
00:01:52,360 --> 00:01:55,260
Know yourself and know your enemy,
and you'll never be defeated.

15
00:01:55,720 --> 00:01:56,670
We've already found

16
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:59,100
a Breakthrough to take down the Jianghai Team.

17
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:01,950
I'll go check on the chicken wings.

18
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,000
Bring some over.

19
00:02:04,360 --> 00:02:04,860
This one.

20
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:11,000
Episode 36

21
00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:20,220
Mini, come help!

22
00:02:21,160 --> 00:02:22,140
Coming!

23
00:02:22,780 --> 00:02:24,060
Then I'll head over first.

24
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:35,100
Hey, Sis!

25
00:02:44,200 --> 00:02:45,630
Thanks to Leo's brilliant decision!

26
00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:47,100
Now my mood has greatly improved!

27
00:02:49,480 --> 00:02:51,420
Will Leo still return to the US after the Tournament?

28
00:02:52,500 --> 00:02:53,500
Hm...

29
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:55,260
Will he come back or not?

30
00:02:57,820 --> 00:02:59,100
The soup over at Mark's side isn't ready yet.

31
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:00,540
I'll go check.

32
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:06,090
Monica, let me help you.

33
00:03:06,100 --> 00:03:07,230
No.

34
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:08,830
Clumsy oaf, who asked for your help?

35
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:10,230
Oh, dear.

36
00:03:10,230 --> 00:03:11,550
Let me help you.

37
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:12,540
I just don't want you to work too hard.

38
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:13,500
No, no.

39
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:14,260
This isn't your job.

40
00:03:14,320 --> 00:03:15,420
No, no!

41
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:19,000
Ahhh!!!

42
00:03:22,300 --> 00:03:23,580
What's wrong? What's wrong?

43
00:03:25,480 --> 00:03:25,980
Matthew!

44
00:03:26,440 --> 00:03:26,940
How did this happen?

45
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:27,990
Why weren't you careful?

46
00:03:28,360 --> 00:03:28,860
What happened!?

47
00:03:29,320 --> 00:03:30,780
Matthew's finger was cut by a knife.

48
00:03:31,720 --> 00:03:32,700
Quick, get a band-aid.

49
00:03:33,440 --> 00:03:34,140
I didn't bring any!

50
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:37,020
How did this happen?

51
00:03:39,100 --> 00:03:41,340
Matthew, should we go to the Hospital?

52
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:43,740
If his finger is injured, he can't compete.

53
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:45,660
If it's amputated, that'll be trouble.

54
00:03:45,720 --> 00:03:46,620
Don't talk nonsense.

55
00:03:48,040 --> 00:03:49,020
Monica!

56
00:03:50,750 --> 00:03:52,860
Monica, how could you? So careless!

57
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:54,780
You're way too rough.

58
00:03:55,040 --> 00:03:56,190
Not ladylike at all.

59
00:03:56,200 --> 00:03:57,180
You're practically a shrew.

60
00:03:57,640 --> 00:03:58,140
Inhumane.

61
00:03:58,200 --> 00:03:58,900
Intolerable!

62
00:03:59,600 --> 00:04:00,500
That's Enough!

63
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:01,980
See for yourselves.

64
00:04:02,920 --> 00:04:04,380
You accused me without seeing clearly.

65
00:04:06,760 --> 00:04:07,740
See that?

66
00:04:08,200 --> 00:04:09,180
You were all fooled by him.

67
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:11,580
Wow, Matthew!

68
00:04:12,020 --> 00:04:13,980
Matthew! You've learned to deceive people too.

69
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:17,340
I was just joking.

70
00:04:18,760 --> 00:04:19,740
You scared me to death.

71
00:04:20,200 --> 00:04:20,700
Not manly at all.

72
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:22,140
You're practically a villain.

73
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:23,100
An animal!

74
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:25,020
Intolerable!

75
00:04:25,180 --> 00:04:25,980
Right.

76
00:04:29,400 --> 00:04:30,780
It's not that serious.

77
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:33,180
Matthew, you must be punished.

78
00:04:34,120 --> 00:04:36,060
Your punishment is to build the fire for everyone!

79
00:04:36,520 --> 00:04:37,500
And boiling water.

80
00:04:37,760 --> 00:04:38,460
Pouring drinks.

81
00:04:39,100 --> 00:04:39,900
Grilling chicken wings.

82
00:04:40,160 --> 00:04:41,340
And swatting mosquitoes for me.

83
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:44,220
And finally, cleanup duty and collecting trash.

84
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:45,180
Right.

85
00:04:45,440 --> 00:04:46,140
No problem, no problem.

86
00:04:47,080 --> 00:04:48,540
As long as Popcorn stops acting like a lady.

87
00:04:49,760 --> 00:04:52,380
What did you say? Am I not a lady?

88
00:04:53,980 --> 00:04:55,260
I agree with everything you say.

89
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:57,180
But when it comes to being a "lady,"

90
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:01,980
I think you're more like a Witch.

91
00:05:03,100 --> 00:05:05,820
So I'm a Witch, huh?

92
00:05:06,180 --> 00:05:06,780
Oh, really?

93
00:05:07,100 --> 00:05:08,220
I'll show you what a real Witch is.

94
00:05:10,120 --> 00:05:11,100
She's serious.

95
00:05:12,520 --> 00:05:13,470
Stop right there.

96
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:14,940
I'll make you play Yo-Yo with your left hand from now on.

97
00:05:16,840 --> 00:05:17,340
Slow down.

98
00:05:18,760 --> 00:05:19,260
Stop!

99
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:23,070
I'm against violence! Help!

100
00:05:23,080 --> 00:05:24,060
Help! Somebody help me!

101
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:26,000
Be careful!

102
00:05:26,400 --> 00:05:27,000
Slow down.

103
00:05:30,280 --> 00:05:33,660
Help! Help!

104
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:36,030
Stop right there!

105
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:36,540
I'm sorry.

106
00:05:38,620 --> 00:05:40,380
Stop chasing! It's time to eat!

107
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:57,180
We've been waiting for you forever!

108
00:05:59,560 --> 00:06:01,020
Why did you call me here?

109
00:06:01,280 --> 00:06:02,420
Ask our Captain yourself.

110
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:23,580
I'm sorry.

111
00:06:24,520 --> 00:06:26,460
I won't join the Saint Qiao Team.

112
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:31,740
And I definitely won't reveal
the Jianghai Team's Signature Moves

113
00:06:32,200 --> 00:06:34,140
to help the Saint Qiao Team win the Championship.

114
00:06:42,760 --> 00:06:46,620
Good. I admire your Integrity.

115
00:06:48,220 --> 00:06:50,940
But you're already leaving Jianghai High School

116
00:06:51,400 --> 00:06:53,340
and transferring to our Saint Qiao High School.

117
00:06:54,760 --> 00:06:56,700
If you don't join our Saint Qiao YoYo Team,

118
00:06:57,720 --> 00:06:59,100
which Team do you want to join?

119
00:06:59,740 --> 00:07:01,020
Don't be so ungrateful.

120
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:04,860
So many people want to join the Saint Qiao Team

121
00:07:05,500 --> 00:07:06,980
but don't even have the Qualifications.

122
00:07:09,340 --> 00:07:10,140
At worst,

123
00:07:11,840 --> 00:07:15,420
I'll just never play Yo-Yo again.

124
00:07:18,460 --> 00:07:19,740
Listen to him.

125
00:07:20,380 --> 00:07:23,100
Is that something a Yo-Yo Competitor would say?

126
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:26,940
Teddy.

127
00:07:28,060 --> 00:07:29,340
Are you really willing

128
00:07:29,500 --> 00:07:31,260
to let those Third-Rate Players take the stage

129
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:35,100
while you'd rather give up the Competition

130
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:37,500
and just be a Spectator?

131
00:07:39,580 --> 00:07:40,860
Do you think by doing this

132
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:45,180
those Jianghai Teammates will thank you?

133
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:53,820
I don't believe it at all.

134
00:07:59,080 --> 00:07:59,580
Let me tell you.

135
00:08:00,040 --> 00:08:01,980
Whether you join the Saint Qiao Team or not,

136
00:08:03,400 --> 00:08:05,820
as soon as you set foot in Saint Qiao High School,

137
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:08,220
those Jianghai Teammates

138
00:08:09,060 --> 00:08:10,620
will already see you as an Opponent.

139
00:08:13,480 --> 00:08:15,420
It's the simplest logic in the World.

140
00:08:16,840 --> 00:08:19,740
We very much welcome a talent like you

141
00:08:19,900 --> 00:08:22,140
joining our Saint Qiao High School.

142
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:26,940
Here you'll achieve great things.

143
00:08:33,140 --> 00:08:37,500
But even without you,

144
00:08:39,400 --> 00:08:43,740
the Championship still belongs to our Saint Qiao Team.

145
00:08:49,460 --> 00:08:51,420
I can also tell you,

146
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:54,780
once I defeat Leo,

147
00:08:55,900 --> 00:08:58,140
I'll return to the US.

148
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:01,020
With your ability,

149
00:09:02,140 --> 00:09:06,780
becoming the Captain of the Saint Qiao Team
in the future won't be a problem.

150
00:09:09,640 --> 00:09:12,220
Coach, what do you think?

151
00:09:13,660 --> 00:09:14,940
Of course.

152
00:09:17,800 --> 00:09:18,780
Well...

153
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:20,700
Let me think about it.

154
00:09:21,060 --> 00:09:21,660
No problem.

155
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:25,500
It's just that there's not much time left.

156
00:09:36,520 --> 00:09:37,980
So ungrateful.

157
00:09:40,360 --> 00:09:42,300
I believe he'll make the right decision.

158
00:09:43,720 --> 00:09:44,700
Actually,

159
00:09:48,040 --> 00:09:49,980
he's already made his decision.

160
00:11:54,280 --> 00:11:55,260
Hello, this is Mark.

161
00:11:57,160 --> 00:11:59,100
Mickey, slow down.

162
00:12:00,520 --> 00:12:02,460
What? Teddy is going to Saint Qiao High School?

163
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:05,490
Alright, alright, I'm coming right away.

164
00:12:07,260 --> 00:12:08,390
How did this happen?

165
00:12:15,200 --> 00:12:17,340
How could there be no hint of this beforehand?

166
00:12:18,130 --> 00:12:20,700
Exactly. If I weren't so well-informed,

167
00:12:20,860 --> 00:12:22,620
We would've been kept completely in the dark.

168
00:12:22,780 --> 00:12:24,540
Monica, is your information reliable?

169
00:12:25,480 --> 00:12:26,940
Of course, it's absolutely true.

170
00:12:27,580 --> 00:12:28,660
Then Teddy has really gone too far.

171
00:12:29,400 --> 00:12:30,780
He's practically a Traitor.

172
00:12:30,940 --> 00:12:32,610
Mickey, we haven't figured things out yet.

173
00:12:33,020 --> 00:12:35,100
What more is there to figure out?

174
00:12:35,560 --> 00:12:37,500
It must be because we didn't let him be Captain last time.

175
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:38,460
That's why he did this.

176
00:12:39,200 --> 00:12:41,340
Right, and he's been skipping Team Activities.

177
00:12:42,760 --> 00:12:43,990
He's pulling a fast one behind our backs.

178
00:12:47,260 --> 00:12:48,060
I actually think

179
00:12:48,220 --> 00:12:50,460
Teddy wouldn't transfer over just
because he wasn't made Captain.

180
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:51,420
Why not?

181
00:12:52,000 --> 00:12:53,340
I think he's capable of anything.

182
00:12:53,800 --> 00:12:56,220
Mickey, stop arguing. It's frustrating enough already.

183
00:12:57,640 --> 00:13:01,980
Hey, do you think Teddy will join the Saint Qiao Team?

184
00:13:02,920 --> 00:13:03,900
Do you even need to ask?

185
00:13:04,160 --> 00:13:05,340
Then we're in deep trouble.

186
00:13:05,800 --> 00:13:07,450
Teddy might know all my Signature Moves.

187
00:13:08,480 --> 00:13:10,620
Didn't I ask you to keep it secret and only show Leo?

188
00:13:11,560 --> 00:13:14,460
But I didn't think Teddy would transfer either.

189
00:13:15,880 --> 00:13:18,300
Then who else showed Teddy their Signature Moves?

190
00:13:32,200 --> 00:13:33,150
Sis!

191
00:13:33,160 --> 00:13:34,620
When did you show Teddy your Signature Move?

192
00:13:35,560 --> 00:13:38,010
Last time in the Training Room,
I was practicing my Signature Move,

193
00:13:39,200 --> 00:13:41,820
He just happened to walked by
and even gave me some pointers.

194
00:13:42,360 --> 00:13:44,220
I had no idea it would turn out like this.

195
00:13:45,340 --> 00:13:46,620
Matthew might have too.

196
00:13:47,360 --> 00:13:49,980
He usually talks to Teddy about everything.

197
00:13:50,720 --> 00:13:51,900
Oh, you guys.

198
00:13:53,320 --> 00:13:58,620
"The heart yearns to remain, yet the person leaves,
and we're left with sorrow on both sides."

199
00:13:59,080 --> 00:14:00,760
Alright, Shawn.

200
00:14:00,770 --> 00:14:03,020
Stop babbling, okay?

201
00:14:06,280 --> 00:14:07,260
Everyone, calm down.

202
00:14:07,900 --> 00:14:09,520
We haven't figured out Teddy's situation yet.

203
00:14:10,400 --> 00:14:11,550
First, we should stay calm.

204
00:14:11,560 --> 00:14:13,980
Calm? How can I be calm?

205
00:14:18,080 --> 00:14:20,220
The Saint Qiao Team's skills are already above ours.

206
00:14:21,640 --> 00:14:23,580
And Teddy's Technique was ranked third on the Team.

207
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:26,760
If he joins the Saint Qiao Team,

208
00:14:28,060 --> 00:14:29,340
even if our Moves aren't leaked,

209
00:14:29,800 --> 00:14:31,260
it'll still be hard to win.

210
00:14:31,700 --> 00:14:33,410
Panicking isn't going to help anything!

211
00:14:36,320 --> 00:14:37,020
No!

212
00:14:37,280 --> 00:14:38,430
I have to talk to Teddy.

213
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:39,720
I have to find out exactly what's going on!

214
00:14:41,320 --> 00:14:43,740
Monica, did you notify Matthew?

215
00:14:43,970 --> 00:14:47,100
I did, but as soon as he heard, he hung up.

216
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:49,500
That Matthew.

217
00:14:49,960 --> 00:14:51,820
Who knows what stupid thing he'll do out of impulse.

218
00:14:54,760 --> 00:14:55,260
I'll get the door.

219
00:15:02,620 --> 00:15:03,230
Teddy.

220
00:15:03,540 --> 00:15:04,070
Matthew.

221
00:15:07,700 --> 00:15:08,700
Explain yourself to everyone.

222
00:15:09,520 --> 00:15:11,280
Teddy, what's going on?

223
00:15:12,700 --> 00:15:13,500
Spit it out!

224
00:15:13,920 --> 00:15:16,380
Teddy, if you're having difficulties, just say so.

225
00:15:16,840 --> 00:15:17,820
What difficulties could he have?

226
00:15:18,280 --> 00:15:20,700
He's already a Saint Qiao High School Member now.

227
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:23,580
So it's true.

228
00:15:24,040 --> 00:15:25,980
Teddy, you're way out of line.

229
00:15:26,920 --> 00:15:28,380
What's so out of line?

230
00:15:29,020 --> 00:15:30,780
Then why did you transfer to Saint Qiao High School?

231
00:15:31,500 --> 00:15:33,180
Just because you didn't get to be Captain?

232
00:15:34,120 --> 00:15:35,580
Alright, everyone calm down.

233
00:15:37,810 --> 00:15:40,380
Teddy, can you explain your situation to us?

234
00:15:41,320 --> 00:15:44,700
My Mom is making me transfer Schools!
I don't have a choice!

235
00:15:45,640 --> 00:15:46,620
So that's how it is.

236
00:15:48,220 --> 00:15:50,460
Teddy, everyone's worried.

237
00:15:50,920 --> 00:15:52,380
They don't want you to leave either.

238
00:15:53,320 --> 00:15:54,300
I know.

239
00:15:55,240 --> 00:15:57,180
But since I've transferred to Saint Qiao High School,

240
00:15:57,640 --> 00:15:59,070
there's nothing wrong with me
joining the Saint Qiao Team right?

241
00:15:59,800 --> 00:16:01,950
What? You're really joining the Saint Qiao Team?!

242
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:03,900
Why didn't you mention it earlier?

243
00:16:04,840 --> 00:16:06,780
You were so fierce, how could I tell you?

244
00:16:07,250 --> 00:16:09,180
Teddy, how could you do this to us?

245
00:16:10,120 --> 00:16:11,580
Exactly. You joining the Saint Qiao Team

246
00:16:12,040 --> 00:16:13,500
makes you an enemy of the Jianghai Team.

247
00:16:13,990 --> 00:16:14,790
You're a traitor.

248
00:16:14,900 --> 00:16:15,900
Enough!

249
00:16:17,320 --> 00:16:19,260
You can't force me to give up Yo-Yo.

250
00:16:28,840 --> 00:16:29,820
If you want to curse me, fine.

251
00:16:30,760 --> 00:16:34,140
If you won't forgive me, fine. I accept it.

252
00:16:35,560 --> 00:16:37,020
But you have to think about my side too.

253
00:16:38,440 --> 00:16:40,860
I Trained just as hard as you guys,
and sweated just as much!

254
00:16:42,280 --> 00:16:44,700
I also want to prove myself at the Tournament!

255
00:16:46,020 --> 00:16:47,100
Is that wrong?!

256
00:16:50,240 --> 00:16:51,900
Why should I only be a Spectator?

257
00:16:52,840 --> 00:16:54,780
Why take away my right to play Yo-Yo?

258
00:17:02,920 --> 00:17:06,380
Mark, ever since I joined the Jianghai Team,

259
00:17:08,200 --> 00:17:10,690
I've always had your back. You should understand me.

260
00:17:17,320 --> 00:17:19,260
Matthew, what about you?

261
00:17:20,200 --> 00:17:21,660
I really want to beat you up right now.

262
00:17:22,600 --> 00:17:24,990
Teddy, if you've got the guts, take our Signature Moves

263
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:26,460
to Michael and tell them everything.

264
00:17:26,720 --> 00:17:27,420
We're not afraid.

265
00:17:28,060 --> 00:17:29,340
Matthew, don't be like that!

266
00:17:31,240 --> 00:17:32,220
Since you're all so heartless,

267
00:17:33,640 --> 00:17:35,100
then I have nothing more to say.

268
00:17:36,520 --> 00:17:37,990
We'll settle this on the Competition Stage.

269
00:17:40,060 --> 00:17:40,860
Teddy!

270
00:17:41,020 --> 00:17:42,270
Don't stop him.

271
00:17:42,280 --> 00:17:43,260
Let him go.

272
00:17:43,720 --> 00:17:46,140
Pretend the Jianghai Team never knew him.

273
00:17:55,040 --> 00:17:58,620
A loss may turn out to be a gain.

274
00:18:00,120 --> 00:18:01,980
I sense an intense killing intent!

275
00:18:07,120 --> 00:18:08,700
The Jianghai Team's Signature Moves,

276
00:18:09,640 --> 00:18:11,580
We've already studied them thoroughly.

277
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:14,940
The next key point is

278
00:18:15,880 --> 00:18:18,300
you two follow the Corresponding Moves I've designed,

279
00:18:18,760 --> 00:18:20,700
and execute them accordingly.

280
00:18:22,120 --> 00:18:23,580
As long as we follow the plan step by step,

281
00:18:24,520 --> 00:18:27,420
